{
  "id": "ACT.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Lät 3",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ca wut mi duääny jakä gɔaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cäŋ kɛl cu Pi-tɔr kɛnɛ Jɔ̱ɔ̱n wä luaak Kuɔth kɛ gua̱a̱th palä kɛ bua̱k ca̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tëëkɛ wut mi duääny ni däpädɛ mi la naŋkɛ thok luaak Kuɔth, mi cɔal i̱ Thok mi tekɛ Maan, kɛ ɣöö bɛ nɛy tin wä rɛy luaak Kuɔth lim kɛ yio̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cɛ Pi-tɔr kɛnɛ Jɔ̱ɔ̱n nɛn wäkɛ luaak Kuɔth, cuɛ kɛ lim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Pi-tɔr kɛnɛ Jɔ̱ɔ̱n ɛ diel guec, kä cukɛ wee i̱, “Guic kɔ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ guic, carɛ jɛ i̱ dɔ̱ŋ bɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱r jek kä kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Pi-tɔr ɛ jiök i̱, “Ɣän thilɛ ɣä yio̱w dääpä, kä duundɛ ɣöö min tekɛ ɣä bä jɛ ka̱m ji̱. Kɛ ciöt Yecu Kritho raan Na-dha-rɛth, jiɛc rɔ kä jäli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jɛ käp tetdä cuëëcdɛ kä cuɛ jɛ jiac nhial, kä cu ciökɛ kɛnɛ copkɛ buɔ̱m ni kä kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ rɔ yuɔr nhial cuɛ cuɔ̱ŋ kɛ ciökɛ, kä cuɛ tok kɛ mi jälɛ kä cuɛ wä rɛy luaak Kuɔth kɛ kɛ kɛɛl, jälɛ kä räwɛ kä liakɛ Kuoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy diaal ɛ nɛn, jälɛ kä liakɛ Kuoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛn ɛ ŋic ɛn ɣöö ɛ jɛn ram in la nyuur thok luaak Kuɔth Thok in tekɛ Maan limɛ naath. Kä cukɛ ga̱a̱c kä cuɛ wuɔ̱thkiɛn yi̱c kɛ min ci tuɔɔk kä jɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruac Pi-tɔr rɛy luaak Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci wut ɛmɔ rɔ ka̱p kä Pi-tɔr kɛnɛ Jɔ̱ɔ̱n, cu naath diaal ga̱a̱c kä cukɛ riŋ kä kɛ kä Yacɛ Thɔ-lo-mon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci Pi-tɔr ɛ nɛn, cuɛ ruac kɛ naath i̱, “Yɛn ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, ɛŋu gääy nɛmɛ yɛ mɔ, kä ɛŋu guecɛ kɔ mɔ ce̱tkɛ mi ɛ buɔ̱mda kiɛ gɔɔyda ɛnɔ jak wut ɛmɛ kä jäl ɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuoth gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɔn ni A-bɛ-ram, kɛnɛ Ay-dhɛk kɛ Je-kɔb cɛ läätdɛ ni Yecu ka̱m buɔ̱m, min ci yɛn ɛ thöp kä cia gak nhiam Pay-lɛt, cäŋ ni mëë cɛ go̱r ɛn ɣöö derɛ jɛ lony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cia Ram in rɛl rɔ kä Gua̱n Cuŋni lo̱k, kä cuarɛ thiec ni ɣöö bɛ yɛ luɔ̱ny ram mi nääk nath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cia Ram in no̱o̱ŋ tëk in ci Kuoth ɛ jiɛc li̱th näk. Kä kɛ kɔn nëën kä nɛmɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ŋa̱th kɛ ciötdɛ, kä puɔ̱ny cio̱tädɛ, cɛ wut ɛmɛ jakä gɔaa, ɛn ram ɛ nɛ̈nɛ kä ŋa̱cɛ ɛ. Kä ɛ jɛn ŋa̱th kɛ Yecu ɛnɔ ci wut ɛmɔ moc pual pua̱ny nhiamdun diaal ɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä täämɛ dämaari, ɣän ŋa̱cä jɛ ɛn ɣöö cia mɛmɛ la̱t a kui̱c yɛn ɛ, ce̱tkɛ min ci kua̱rkun ɛ la̱t bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ jɛn duɔ̱ɔ̱p ɛmɔ cu Kuoth mëë cɛ lar jak kä thuɔ̱ɔ̱k kɛ thuk göökni diaal ɛn ɣöö bi Mɛ-thia ti bɛ̈c bɛ̈ɛ̈c rut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, rietdɛ rɔ̱ kä dueerkun, kä rietdɛ lo̱ckun Kuoth, kɛ ɣöö ba dueerkun woc, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö dee gua̱a̱th gɔɔyä nɔmɔ ben kä Kuäär ni Kuɔth, kɛnɛ ɣöö derɛ Mɛ-thia min ca kuany kɛ kui̱dun ja̱k min lap Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɛn bɛ dhil te nhial, amäni gua̱a̱th in ba ŋɔak diaal jakä cuŋ, tëë ci Kuoth kɛ lat kɛ thuk gööknikɛ tëë cieŋ ni wal tin rɛ̈l kɛ rɔ̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Muthɛ wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:22-23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t 18:15-16, 19.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ‘Bi Kuäär ni Kuoth in la Kuothdu yɛ jiëc gök rɛy dämuɔɔri mi ce̱tkɛ ɣä. Kä bia min bɛ la̱t yɛ liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bɛ te inɛ, kä nɛy diaal tin /ca ruac go̱kä mɛmɛ bi liŋ ba kɛ däk rɛy nath.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä göök diaal tin ci ruac, tuɔɔkɛ ni kä Tha-muɛl amäni göök tin bëë kɔɔr, cikɛ ruac lat kɛ kui̱ ni̱ni ti̱ti̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapɛ gaat göökni kɛnɛ mat ruac ëë ci Kuoth ɛ ka̱m gua̱ndɔɔŋnikun mëë jio̱kɛ A-bɛ-ram i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tuk 22:18.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ‘Ba döör wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n diaal poth kɛ kuayku.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci Kuoth raan läätdɛ jiɛc, cuɛ jɛ jäkä yɛ kɛ nhiam, kɛ ɣöö bɛ yɛ poth kɛ rietdun kɛ rɔ̱ yɛn diaal jiäknikun.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
